{"seq":8,"slug":"distributed-transactions-consistency","title":"分布式事务与一致性","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","categoryLabel":"后端工程","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency","rating":{"composite":3.82,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 分布式事务与一致性 简介\n\n跨多个节点或服务维持数据正确，是分布式后端最深的难题。本 hub 面向需要理解一致性理论以做出清醒架构取舍的后端工程师，从一致性模型（CAP/PACELC、强一致与最终一致光谱、分布式隔离级别）讲起，覆盖提交协议（2PC、3PC 的极限、TCC）、共识（共识问题、Raft 直觉、法定人数与复制），以及一致性抉择（线性一致的代价、为系统选模型、工程实践）。它从理论侧补全姊妹 hub「幂等、重试与补偿」的应用侧。贯穿全篇的主线与整个后端工程品类一致：一致性是手段不是目的，把强一致需求收进尽量小的边界用本地事务保证，其余用最终一致换性能与可用，并拥抱 CAP/FLP 揭示的根本不可能性。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"consistency-models","title":"Consistency Models","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/consistency-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cap-and-pacelc","title":"CAP 与 PACELC","url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/consistency-models/cap-and-pacelc","wordCount":1694,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"strong-vs-eventual","title":"强一致与最终一致","url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/consistency-models/strong-vs-eventual","wordCount":1620,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"isolation-levels-distributed","title":"分布式环境下的隔离级别","url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/consistency-models/isolation-levels-distributed","wordCount":1704,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章铺陈一致性的理论基础：CAP 定理「分区时在一致与可用间取舍」及 PACELC 对日常延迟代价的补全、从线性一致到最终一致的一致性光谱及读己之写等实用中间模型，以及与一致性模型正交、关注并发事务可见性的隔离级别（含分布式下的写偏斜）。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"commit-protocols","title":"Commit Protocols","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/commit-protocols","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"two-phase-commit","title":"两阶段提交","url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/commit-protocols/two-phase-commit","wordCount":1491,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"three-phase-and-limits","title":"三阶段提交与协议的极限","url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/commit-protocols/three-phase-and-limits","wordCount":1741,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"tcc-try-confirm-cancel","title":"TCC 事务模型：尝试-确认-取消（Try-Confirm-Cancel）","url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/commit-protocols/tcc-try-confirm-cancel","wordCount":1625,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲跨节点原子提交协议：2PC 的两阶段机制与其阻塞、单点、低可用等固有缺陷，3PC 试图非阻塞却暴露 FLP 揭示的根本不可能性，以及在业务层用预留-确认-取消、避开长锁的 TCC——它是 2PC 思想在应用层的体现，介于 2PC 与 Saga 之间。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"consensus","title":"Consensus","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/consensus","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"consensus-problem","title":"共识问题","url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/consensus/consensus-problem","wordCount":1520,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"raft-intuition","title":"Raft 的直觉","url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/consensus/raft-intuition","wordCount":1551,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"quorums-and-replication","title":"法定人数与复制","url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/consensus/quorums-and-replication","wordCount":1633,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲共识：让一组节点就某值达成一致的问题（一致性/有效性/终止性）及其在故障网络下的困难与多数派机制，为可理解性而设计的 Raft 三大组成（leader 选举、日志复制、安全性）的直觉，以及法定人数复制（W+R>N）作为可调一致性旋钮与共识的区别。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"choosing-consistency","title":"Choosing Consistency","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/choosing-consistency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"linearizability-cost","title":"线性一致的代价","url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/choosing-consistency/linearizability-cost","wordCount":1715,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"picking-a-model","title":"为系统选择一致性模型","url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/choosing-consistency/picking-a-model","wordCount":1496,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"consistency-in-practice","title":"一致性的工程实践","url":"/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/choosing-consistency/consistency-in-practice","wordCount":1835,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章把理论收束为抉择：线性一致那「仿佛单份数据」的代价（日常延迟、吞吐、可用性）与为何不该默认它、按数据分类→问题判断→强一致收进小边界→映射手段的选型方法，以及信任但验证存储保证、应用层处理不一致、用混沌工程验证的工程实践。\n"}]}